<mjml>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hello {{name}},</mj-text>
        <mj-text>We've received your request to delete your ilovelawyer account. Your account and all associated data will be permanently deleted on {{scheduledFor}}, {{gracePeriodDays}} days from now.</mj-text>
        <mj-text>Changed your mind? Sign in and cancel the request from your profile's Danger Zone at any time before then.</mj-text>
        <mj-text>If you didn't request this, please sign in and cancel it, or contact support.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
